t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3e3406cd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3e3406cd\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1244258e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1244258e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7397d5c7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7397d5c7\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b7197a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7b7197a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">CamTech University is thrilled to announce its official membership in the University Incubator Consortium (UNIIC) as of 2023. In May 2024, we proudly signed the UNIIC Memorandum of Agreement (MOA) alongside universities from ASEAN countries, India, and South Africa.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The University Incubator Consortium (UNIIC) collaborates with university partners across the ASEAN, Indian, and African regions. Its objective is to enhance capabilities in assisting startups, facilitate the exchange of knowledge and skills, and foster resource-sharing.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">UNIIC offers a diverse range of opportunities for participants to advance their business ideas, including:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Mutual Visits:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Student and staff exchange programs<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Access to Support and Facilities:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Use of state-of-the-art incubation centers<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Joint Events:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Organizing ideation bootcamps, competitions, and accelerator programs<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Mentorship and Training:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Providing mentor sharing and training sessions for startups and spin-off companies<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Advisory Services:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Guidance on regulatory requirements and market understanding<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Investment Guidance:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Assistance with venture capitalists or angel investors<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Collaborative Research:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Joint research projects in entrepreneurship<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Curriculum Sharing:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Exchange of curriculum and teaching materials related to entrepreneurship programs<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Program Development:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Creating new programs related to entrepreneurship<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The consortium includes 16 university partners, such as:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Asia Pacific University (Malaysia)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tra Vinh University (Vietnam)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Can Tho University (Vietnam)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hung Vuong University (Vietnam)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Universitas Trisakti (Indonesia)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Universitas Indonesia<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Universitas Telkom (Indonesia)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Universitas Multimedia Nusantara (Indonesia)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Palawan State University (Philippines)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Western Philippines University (Philippines)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mindoro State University (Philippines)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chea Sim University of Kamchaymear (Cambodia)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cambodia University of Technology and Science (Cambodia)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">University of Mpumalanga (South Africa)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Coimbatore Institute of Technology (India)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adamson University (Philippines)<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d063a04 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7d063a04\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c7df1f6 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height